<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Growth on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/growth/</link><description>Recent content in Growth on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/growth/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>marketingskills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/coreyhaines31-marketingskills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/coreyhaines31-marketingskills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;product-marketing&lt;/strong&gt;: Foundational skill that other marketing skills check first for shared context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cro&lt;/strong&gt;: Covers conversion rate optimization workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;copywriting&lt;/strong&gt;: Provides guidance for writing marketing copy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;seo-audit&lt;/strong&gt;: Runs an SEO audit of a site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ai-seo&lt;/strong&gt;: Optimizes content for AI-driven search and discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;programmatic-seo&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds programmatic SEO pages at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ab-testing&lt;/strong&gt;: Sets up and analyzes A/B tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;analytics&lt;/strong&gt;: Covers analytics setup and interpretation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;churn-prevention&lt;/strong&gt;: Identifies and addresses customer churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;referrals&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds referral and growth loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;pricing&lt;/strong&gt;: Provides guidance on pricing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;launch&lt;/strong&gt;: Coordinates product launch workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cold-email&lt;/strong&gt;: Drafts cold outreach emails.&lt;/li&gt;
